# Mutation testing runs GenerateMojoTest with the module directory as its working directory, and
# PIT's mutant of firstNonBlank returns "" for the output directory, which Path.of resolves to
# exactly that. The diagram lands here rather than in the test's temporary directory. It is an
# artifact of -Pmutation, not of any build a user runs.
